"><msubsup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">\u222b</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msubsup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">\u222b</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>This resembles the basic integral for inverse secant:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"248\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mfrac space=\"2\"><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-n